[
  {
    "name": "Telegram Bot",
    "nodes": [
      {
        "parameters": {
          "updates": ["message"],
          "polling": true,
          "pollingInterval": 500
        },
        "id": "tel-trigger-001",
        "name": "Telegram Trigger",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegramTrigger",
        "typeVersion": 1,
        "position": [250, 300],
        "credentials": {}
      },
      {
        "parameters": {
          "mode": "rules",
          "dataType": "string",
          "value1": "={{ $json.message.text.toLowerCase() }}",
          "rules": {
            "rules": [
              {
                "value2": "/start",
                "output": 0,
                "operation": "startsWith"
              },
              {
                "value2": "/help",
                "output": 1,
                "operation": "startsWith"
              },
              {
                "value2": "^/docs list",
                "output": 2,
                "operation": "regex"
              },
              {
                "value2": "^/docs folders",
                "output": 3,
                "operation": "regex"
              },
              {
                "value2": "^/podcast gen(?:erate)? \\d+",
                "output": 4,
                "operation": "regex"
              },
              {
                "value2": "^/podcast gen_folder",
                "output": 5,
                "operation": "regex"
              },
              {
                "value2": "/ask",
                "output": 6,
                "operation": "startsWith"
              },
              {
                "value2": "/podcast",
                "output": 7,
                "operation": "startsWith"
              },
              {
                "value2": "^/create docs",
                "output": 8,
                "operation": "regex"
              },
              {
                "value2": "^/create podcast",
                "output": 9,
                "operation": "regex"
              }
            ],
            "fallbackOutput": 10
          }
        },
        "id": "switch-route-003",
        "name": "Route Command",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
        "typeVersion": 2,
        "position": [650, 300]
      },
      {
        "parameters": {
          "resource": "message",
          "operation": "sendMessage",
          "chatId": "={{ $node['Telegram Trigger'].json.message.chat.id }}",
          "text": "🎓 ¡Bienvenido a StudiedUp!\n\nSoy tu asistente de estudio académico. Puedes hacerme preguntas sobre tus documentos o generar podcasts educativos.\n\nUsa /help para ver los comandos disponibles.",
          "additionalFields": {}
        },
        "id": "tel-welcome-004",
        "name": "Send Welcome",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
        "typeVersion": 1,
        "position": [850, 100],
        "credentials": {}
      },
      {
        "parameters": {
          "resource": "message",
          "operation": "sendMessage",
          "chatId": "={{ $node['Telegram Trigger'].json.message.chat.id }}",
          "text": "📋 Comandos disponibles:\n\n/docs list [página] — Lista documentos (con paginación)\n/docs folders [página] — Lista carpetas monitoreadas\n/podcast gen ID — Genera podcast de un documento\n/podcast gen_folder ruta — Genera podcast de toda una carpeta\n/create docs tema — Crea un documento educativo desde cero\n/create podcast tema — Crea un podcast desde cero (sin documento previo)\n/ask pregunta — Pregunta sobre tus documentos (RAG)\n/help — Este mensaje\n\n💡 Ej: /docs list 2\n💡 Ej: /create docs \"seguridad informática\"\n💡 Ej: /create podcast \"ISO 27001\"",
          "additionalFields": {
            "parse_mode": "HTML"
          }
        },
        "id": "tel-help-005",
        "name": "Send Help",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
        "typeVersion": 1,
        "position": [850, 200],
        "credentials": {}
      },
      {
        "parameters": {
          "language": "javaScript",
          "jsCode": "const text = $json.message.text;\nconst match = text.match(/^\\/docs list\\s*(\\d+)?/);\nconst page = match && match[1] ? parseInt(match[1]) : 1;\nconst pageSize = 10;\nreturn [{ json: { page, pageSize } }];"
        },
        "id": "code-docs-params-020",
        "name": "Extract Docs Params",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
        "typeVersion": 2,
        "position": [850, 400]
      },
      {
        "parameters": {
          "url": "=http://backend:8000/api/documents?page={{ $json.page }}&page_size={{ $json.pageSize }}",
          "options": {},
          "sendBody": false,
          "method": "GET"
        },
        "id": "http-list-006",
        "name": "List Documents",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
        "typeVersion": 4.2,
        "position": [1050, 400]
      },
      {
        "parameters": {
          "language": "javaScript",
          "jsCode": "const escape = s => s.replace(/&/g, '&amp;').replace(/</g, '&lt;').replace(/>/g, '&gt;');\nconst items = $json.items || [];\nconst total = $json.total || 0;\nconst page = $json.page || 1;\nconst pageSize = $json.page_size || 10;\nconst totalPages = Math.ceil(total / pageSize);\nconst docList = items.map(item => `  ${item.id}. ${escape(item.filename)}`).join('\\n');\nlet text = `📚 Documentos disponibles (${total} totales, página ${page}/${totalPages}):\\n\\n${docList}`;\nif (page < totalPages) text += `\\n\\nUsa: /docs list ${page + 1} para ver más`;\ntext += `\\n\\n🎙️ /podcast gen ID para generar podcast`;\nreturn [{ json: { text } }];"
        },
        "id": "code-format-007",
        "name": "Format Docs List",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
        "typeVersion": 2,
        "position": [1250, 400]
      },
      {
        "parameters": {
          "resource": "message",
          "operation": "sendMessage",
          "chatId": "={{ $node['Telegram Trigger'].json.message.chat.id }}",
          "text": "={{ $json.text }}",
          "additionalFields": {
            "parse_mode": "HTML"
          }
        },
        "id": "tel-docs-008",
        "name": "Send Docs List",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
        "typeVersion": 1,
        "position": [1450, 400],
        "credentials": {}
      },
      {
        "parameters": {
          "language": "javaScript",
          "jsCode": "const text = $json.message.text;\nconst match = text.match(/^\\/docs folders\\s*(\\d+)?/);\nconst page = match && match[1] ? parseInt(match[1]) : 1;\nconst pageSize = 10;\nreturn [{ json: { page, pageSize } }];"
        },
        "id": "code-folders-params-021",
        "name": "Extract Folders Params",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
        "typeVersion": 2,
        "position": [850, 500]
      },
      {
        "parameters": {
          "url": "=http://backend:8000/api/monitor/folders?page={{ $json.page }}&page_size={{ $json.pageSize }}",
          "options": {},
          "sendBody": false,
          "method": "GET"
        },
        "id": "http-list-folders-022",
        "name": "List Folders",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
        "typeVersion": 4.2,
        "position": [1050, 500]
      },
      {
        "parameters": {
          "language": "javaScript",
          "jsCode": "const escape = s => s.replace(/&/g, '&amp;').replace(/</g, '&lt;').replace(/>/g, '&gt;');\nconst items = $json.items || [];\nconst total = $json.total || 0;\nconst page = $json.page || 1;\nconst pageSize = $json.page_size || 10;\nconst totalPages = Math.ceil(total / pageSize);\nconst folderList = items.map(f => `  ${f.id}. ${escape(f.path)}`).join('\\n');\nlet text = `📁 Carpetas monitoreadas (${total} totales, página ${page}/${totalPages}):\\n\\n${folderList}`;\nif (page < totalPages) text += `\\n\\nUsa: /docs folders ${page + 1} para ver más`;\ntext += `\\n\\n🎙️ /podcast gen_folder ruta para generar podcast de toda la carpeta`;\nreturn [{ json: { text } }];"
        },
        "id": "code-format-folders-023",
        "name": "Format Folders List",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
        "typeVersion": 2,
        "position": [1250, 500]
      },
      {
        "parameters": {
          "resource": "message",
          "operation": "sendMessage",
          "chatId": "={{ $node['Telegram Trigger'].json.message.chat.id }}",
          "text": "={{ $json.text }}",
          "additionalFields": {
            "parse_mode": "HTML"
          }
        },
        "id": "tel-send-folders-024",
        "name": "Send Folders List",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
        "typeVersion": 1,
        "position": [1450, 500],
        "credentials": {}
      },
      {
        "parameters": {
          "resource": "message",
          "operation": "sendMessage",
          "chatId": "={{ $node['Telegram Trigger'].json.message.chat.id }}",
          "text": "🎙️ Generando podcast... esto toma unos segundos ⏳",
          "additionalFields": {}
        },
        "id": "tel-gen-009",
        "name": "Send Generating",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
        "typeVersion": 1,
        "position": [850, 600],
        "credentials": {}
      },
      {
        "parameters": {
          "language": "javaScript",
          "jsCode": "const text = $node['Telegram Trigger'].json.message.text;\nconst match = text.match(/^\\/podcast gen(?:erate)? (\\d+)/);\nconst docId = parseInt(match[1]);\nreturn [{ json: { docId } }];"
        },
        "id": "code-extract-010",
        "name": "Extract Doc ID",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
        "typeVersion": 2,
        "position": [1050, 600]
      },
      {
        "parameters": {
          "url": "=http://backend:8000/api/podcasts/by-document/{{ $json.docId }}",
          "options": {},
          "sendBody": false,
          "method": "POST"
        },
        "id": "http-gen-011",
        "name": "Generate Podcast",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
        "typeVersion": 4.2,
        "position": [1250, 600]
      },
      {
        "parameters": {
          "resource": "message",
          "operation": "sendMessage",
          "chatId": "={{ $node['Telegram Trigger'].json.message.chat.id }}",
          "text": "🎙️ Generando podcast desde carpeta... esto toma unos segundos ⏳",
          "additionalFields": {}
        },
        "id": "tel-gen-folder-025",
        "name": "Send Generating Folder",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
        "typeVersion": 1,
        "position": [850, 700],
        "credentials": {}
      },
      {
        "parameters": {
          "language": "javaScript",
          "jsCode": "const text = $node['Telegram Trigger'].json.message.text;\nconst folderPath = text.replace(/^\\/podcast gen_folder\\s*/i, '').trim();\nreturn [{ json: { folder_path: folderPath } }];"
        },
        "id": "code-extract-folder-026",
        "name": "Extract Folder Name",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
        "typeVersion": 2,
        "position": [1050, 700]
      },
      {
        "parameters": {
          "method": "POST",
          "url": "http://backend:8000/api/podcasts/by-folder-path",
          "sendBody": true,
          "specifyBody": "json",
          "jsonBody": "={{ $json }}",
          "sendHeaders": true,
          "headerParameters": {
            "parameters": [
              {
                "name": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ]
          },
          "options": {}
        },
        "id": "http-gen-folder-027",
        "name": "Generate Podcast by Folder",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
        "typeVersion": 4.2,
        "position": [1250, 700]
      },
      {
        "parameters": {
          "language": "javaScript",
          "jsCode": "const podcastId = $json.id;\nconst response = await this.helpers.httpRequest({\n  method: 'GET',\n  url: 'http://backend:8000/api/podcasts/' + podcastId + '/audio',\n  encoding: 'arraybuffer',\n});\nconst buffer = Buffer.from(response);\nconst binaryData = await this.helpers.prepareBinaryData(buffer, 'podcast.mp3', 'audio/mpeg');\nreturn [{ json: { podcastId }, binary: { audioData: binaryData } }];"
        },
        "id": "code-download-018",
        "name": "Download Audio",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
        "typeVersion": 2,
        "position": [1500, 650]
      },
      {
        "parameters": {
          "method": "POST",
          "url": "=https://api.telegram.org/bot{{ $env.TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN }}/sendAudio",
          "sendBody": true,
          "contentType": "multipart-form-data",
          "bodyParameters": {
            "parameters": [
              {
                "name": "chat_id",
                "value": "={{ $node['Telegram Trigger'].json.message.chat.id }}",
                "parameterType": "formData"
              },
              {
                "name": "audio",
                "inputDataFieldName": "audioData",
                "parameterType": "formBinaryData"
              }
            ]
          },
          "options": {}
        },
        "id": "http-sendaudio-019",
        "name": "Send Audio Direct",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
        "typeVersion": 4.2,
        "position": [1850, 650]
      },
      {
        "parameters": {
          "resource": "message",
          "operation": "sendMessage",
          "chatId": "={{ $node['Telegram Trigger'].json.message.chat.id }}",
          "text": "📋 Subcomandos de /podcast:\n\n/podcast gen ID — Generar podcast de un documento\n/podcast gen_folder ruta — Generar podcast de una carpeta\n\nUsa /docs list para ver documentos\nUsa /docs folders para ver carpetas\n\nEj: /podcast gen 5\nEj: /podcast gen_folder /home/docs/mi_materia",
          "additionalFields": {}
        },
        "id": "tel-podhelp-015",
        "name": "Send Podcast Help",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
        "typeVersion": 1,
        "position": [850, 800],
        "credentials": {}
      },
      {
        "parameters": {
          "language": "javaScript",
          "jsCode": "const text = $json.message.text.replace(/^\\/ask\\s*/i, '');\nreturn [{ json: { message: text } }];"
        },
